   The course material -- the notebooks, the lecture slides, the exercises, the quizzes,
   the assignments, the templates, the written text and the source code in this repository
   -- is the joint property of Space42 and the UAE Space Agency.


2. PERMISSION GRANTED TO COURSE PARTICIPANTS

   If you are enrolled in the Space Academy 2026 hyperspectral course, you are permitted,
   at no charge, to:

     (a) copy this repository, including by cloning it and by running it in hosted
         environments such as Google Colab;
     (b) run, study and modify the material for your own learning;
     (c) keep your copy, and your own modifications of it, after the course ends;
     (d) use what you have learned, and code you have written yourself, in your own
         later work without restriction.

   This permission is personal to you and does not expire.


3. WHAT IS NOT PERMITTED

   Without prior written permission from both copyright holders, you may not:

     (a) redistribute, publish, mirror, or share this material, or any substantial part
