   in this licence grants you rights the owner has not granted.

   Planet Tanager imagery, and the products derived from it in data/spectral_library/
   and data/tanager_catalog_index.geojson
       "Tanager STAC Data, available at www.planet.com/data/stac (c) 2025 Planet Labs PBC"
       Licensed CC-BY-4.0. Cite the acquisition year of the scene you used.
       The scene files themselves are not in this repository; they are downloaded from
       Planet's public catalogue when a notebook needs them.

   ESA WorldCover land-cover labels in data/labels/
       (c) ESA WorldCover project / contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2021).
       ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200, licensed CC-BY-4.0, accessed via Microsoft
       Planetary Computer. The files here are aggregated to the Tanager 30 m grid.

   EnMAP Level 2A subset in data/enmap/
       "EnMAP data (c) DLR 2024 All rights reserved", as stated in the product metadata
       file distributed alongside it. Supplied for use within this course only. It is not
       licensed for redistribution by the copyright holders of section 1, and is subject
       to the DLR EnMAP data policy -- see the bundled METADATA.XML.

   Third-party Python packages are used under their own licences; see requirements.txt.

   USGS spectral libraries referenced by the notebooks are works of the United States
   Government and are downloaded by you, not redistributed here.


